  "application": {
    "question": "Calculate AMD FY2024 versus FY2025 revenue growth, gross and operating margins for both years, each margin change in percentage points, and operating cash-flow growth. State actual dates and comparison qualifications; provide a table/chart.",
    "answer": "- AMD revenue rose 34.34%, from $25.785 billion in FY2024 [F1] to $34.639 billion in FY2025 [F5]. [C1]\n- Gross margin increased from 49.35% [C2] to 49.52% [C3], a gain of 0.17 percentage points. [C6]\n- Operating margin increased from 7.37% [C4] to 10.66% [C5], a gain of 3.30 percentage points. [C7]\n- Operating cash flow grew 153.50%, from $3.041 billion [F4] to $7.709 billion. [F8] [C8]\n- Actual fiscal periods:\n  - FY2024: December 31, 2023–December 28, 2024. [F1]\n  - FY2025: December 29, 2024–December 27, 2025. [F5]\n- Comparison basis: USD, annual US GAAP consolidated figures, using each year’s original-report observations—not later revised comparatives. The fiscal intervals are comparable and non-overlapping; no comparison warnings were registered. Margin changes use unrounded calculations.\n- Verified outputs: [CSV table](/api/analysis/e476b260d6e858314103f59e75a2c03578ed07af0d5efdcf3999dfeae68ed305/files/table.csv) · [PNG chart](/api/analysis/e476b260d6e858314103f59e75a2c03578ed07af0d5efdcf3999dfeae68ed305/files/chart.png).",
